#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "最大応答サイズは %d MiB ですが、そのサイズのデコード済み応答は収集メモリ %d MiB に収まりません（リーダーの上限は %d MiB です）。設定で「収集メモリ」を増やすか、「最大応答サイズ」を下げてください。"

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
